  "_comment": "Shared fixture for the generative-UI expression language. Go (internal/genui/expr_test.go) checks `valid` and `refs`; TypeScript (web/src/app/chat/ui/genui/expr.test.ts) checks `valid` and, when present, evaluates against `scope` and compares with `want`. Keep the two halves in step: a case added here runs on both sides.",
